------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ElectricSQL — @electric-sql/pglite, package `pglite-sync`
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The read-path sync engine under `packages/client/src/sync/` and the test suites
listed below were originally seeded from ElectricSQL's `@electric-sql/pglite`
monorepo, package `packages/pglite-sync`:

  Source:  https://github.com/electric-sql/pglite/tree/main/packages/pglite-sync
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Copyright (c) ElectricSQL and contributors

The engine and these suites are now fully internalized (ADR-0009) and owned; they
diverge freely from upstream and upstream compatibility is an explicit anti-goal
(ADR-0028). This attribution is retained because the code began as a copy — the
Apache-2.0 terms are permanent. The seeded-from suites:

  - tests/unit/sync-engine.test.ts                     (from test/sync.test.ts)
  - tests/integration/sync-engine-e2e.integration.test.ts  (from test-e2e/sync-e2e.test.ts)

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

