------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Drizzle Team — drizzle-orm, driver `drizzle-orm/pglite`
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Drizzle driver under `packages/pgwasm/src/drizzle/` (`@pgxsinkit/pgwasm/drizzle`)
began as a copy of drizzle-orm's PGlite driver (`src/pglite/driver.ts`,
`src/pglite/session.ts`, `src/pglite/codecs.ts` at 1.0.0-rc.4), rebound to pgwasm:

  Source:  https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Copyright (c) Drizzle Team and contributors

Changes: the session, transaction and database classes are rebound from PGlite to
pgwasm, and the driver never constructs its own database. The Apache-2.0 terms are
permanent. A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

